WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:10.500
What could your team do with more time for
the mission? Cause on Cue is VNV Events’

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.208
2027 pilot for South Florida nonprofits.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.292
We help produce your fundraiser, from the
event program and audiovisual planning to

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:20.625
the welcome desk.

00:00:20.917 --> 00:00:27.250
With a branded portal, guests can RSVP and
check in while your staff manages approvals

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.333
and arrivals from one list.

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:35.375
At Victoria Venezuela Foundation’s golf
tournament, we connected that workflow with

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:36.958
the on-site team.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:42.000
Tell us what you’re planning, and we’ll
discuss what support fits.
